[gd_scene load_steps=12 format=3]

; c_e2_stair: the old stair under the Emberfall observatory, unsealed. A squat stone stair-house (walls 0.9 m high
; around a 2.0 x 3.4 m well), seven steps dropping from the rim into the dark toward -Z, the broken seal slab leaning
; on the east wall, two Greywater lanterns on the steps and a faint white-gold glow card at the far end (the light
; below). Origin = ground at the centre of the opening; the stair descends toward -Z. 0 lights (emissive only).

